{"title":"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_8\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 8</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Solution_9\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 9</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Solution_10\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 10</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Solution_11\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 11</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031a11d95dbb589d91d23198e7c461c0c196180e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8a+\\log_4b^2=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2ef54a4d521f8ecf3a5229dec3c52afd0c2dab6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8b+\\log_4a^2=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"148\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Use the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Change_of_base_formula\" title=\"Change of base formula\">change of base formula</a> to see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65e3e195b452eaa88d06f58d19d20691b2f0670b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log a}{\\log 8} + \\frac{2 \\log b}{\\log 4} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"145\" height=\"41\" />; combine <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Denominator\" title=\"Denominator\">denominators</a> to find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a8380770a8c09c92100f8cc8daf62dccdc76f11c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log ab^3}{3\\log 2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"91\" height=\"44\" />. Doing the same thing with the second equation yields that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/0/5c003be458e94fc25bafa1e755beaf6e2e896517.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log a^3b}{3\\log 2} = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"88\" height=\"42\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/8/bb81054719bcc49edfab2626b46b6a8da8b73e45.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log ab^3 = 15\\log 2 \\Longrightarrow ab^3 = 2^{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"242\" height=\"18\" /> and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/8/3885cfaa26a2edbe824a568f31a66d0daab2afbd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log a^3 b = 21\\log 2 \\Longrightarrow a^3 b = 2^{21}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"242\" height=\"18\" />. If we multiply the two equations together, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/8/01850392576f47df3c64eded50709e8608673b6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^4b^4 = 2^{36}$\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />, so taking the fourth root of that, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/006a85bc6d6d50f52bc7ebdab2ff8ee402f6d47b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 2^9 = \\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simplify our expressions by changing everything to a common base and by pulling exponents out of the logarithms. The given equations then become <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/d/c9d949ccbcce8ceb9a765ca2bad5df805154019a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\ln a}{\\ln 8} + \\frac{2 \\ln b}{\\ln 4} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/b/c8bf0d8dff745e6b8a2f32d486cab14eb045771c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\ln b}{\\ln 8} + \\frac{2 \\ln a}{\\ln 4} = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"130\" height=\"38\" />. Adding the equations and factoring, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/1/251fac5395e1e8014e22255b9e2107784c1b442a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{1}{\\ln 8}+\\frac{2}{\\ln 4})(\\ln a+ \\ln b)=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"231\" height=\"37\" />. Rearranging we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/9/e99aebc7b8abc923dd743a2c83f456211b465e61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ln ab = \\frac{12}{\\frac{1}{\\ln 8}+\\frac{2}{\\ln 4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"132\" height=\"44\" />. Again, we pull exponents out of our logarithms to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/c/dccd3a589d0d09068eb2f74f9d071dd7bdcd3918.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\ln ab = \\frac{12}{\\frac{1}{3 \\ln 2} + \\frac{2}{2 \\ln 2}} = \\frac{12 \\ln 2}{\\frac{1}{3} + 1} = \\frac{12 \\ln 2}{\\frac{4}{3}} = 9 \\ln 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"368\" height=\"44\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/6/346b4b4680d1f19770b883da37d752812507305c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\ln ab}{\\ln 2} = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"72\" height=\"37\" />. The left-hand side can be interpreted as a base-2 logarithm, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/6/006a85bc6d6d50f52bc7ebdab2ff8ee402f6d47b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 2^9 = \\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>This solution is very similar to the above two, but it utilizes the well-known fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/e/fee6f666c2add199ce8181aec2a57644055fb076.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{m^k}{n^k}= \\log_m{n}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" /> Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/9/489162a2f05286cb39a8088c0422a533f63d640a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8a+\\log_4b^2=5 \\Rightarrow  \\log_{2^3}{(\\sqrt[3]{a})^3} + \\log_{2^2}{b^2} = 5 \\Rightarrow \\log_2{\\sqrt[3]{a}} + \\log_2{b} = 5 \\Rightarrow \\log_2{\\sqrt[3]{a}b} = 5.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"692\" height=\"19\" /> Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/715e171ffd3f461dd1ca3ba89e3ae338c0a7fc04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8b+\\log_4a^2=7 \\Rightarrow \\log_2{\\sqrt[3]{b}a} = 7.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"280\" height=\"22\" /> Adding these two equations, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/9/9c95b4113a49aead2638d8bd84dd365f34ca7e44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2{a^{\\frac{4}{3}}b^{\\frac{4}{3}}} = 12 \\Rightarrow ab = 2^{12\\times\\frac{3}{4}} = 2^9 = \\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"332\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can change everything to a common base, like so: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/8/8381c7d44e80ad9c7fd74044afad7ac2cb656417.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8{a} + \\log_8{b^3} = 5,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"19\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6858a0d7d912429b02168f5bf43e5640d461f4ad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8{b} + \\log_8{a^3} = 7.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"19\" /> We set the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/f/dbfbb081df879160fdc07a35d5f6cda5a9efcf29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, and the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/f/58fafeb7b9618527e58d484bca954148ea8b4c1b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"42\" height=\"17\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/e/56e228943301b048f242377b3b24717037d5996f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"11\" /> Now we have a system of linear equations: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/5/4f5edce5f3438b38f32cc2f38013cd0037345203.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + 3y = 5,\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"16\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/0/c703afa1607ea68e8d9d2cb85639c4ef34600734.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y + 3x = 7.\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" /> Now add the two equations together then simplify, we'll get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/1/2010f7085f97a4a285c0302c0fd7268d37dd114e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />. So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/c/cdc60cd107711bef83bc9458cce0b024e185c5bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8{ab} = \\log_8{a} + \\log_8{b} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"218\" height=\"19\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/c/ddc04b0bebca751b30923213404e2aff1c53d638.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 8^3 = \\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Add the two equations to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/32307eb6199c3335ec04fd8e4d5e16da84bada2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 {a}+ \\log_8 {b}+ \\log_{a^2}+\\log_{b^2}=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"266\" height=\"17\" />. This can be simplified with the log property <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/1/011a935a9194f4a287eee816f1218c83aae1600b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_n {x}+\\log_n {y}=log_n {xy}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"189\" height=\"17\" />. Using this, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/50467d5c0bc1a94906ee46e3aac73877b5598488.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 {ab}+ \\log_4 {a^2b^2}=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"19\" />. Now let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/c/efc45bcc4e89c34f68e6bd7cee3b9f04d2d0a257.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 {ab}=c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/e/deecc4bb64d796990569070dd58f340d5b729e5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 {a^2b^2}=k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"100\" height=\"19\" />. Converting to exponents, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/6/7060a95b12c109e912c778f79ab8c523381e9af9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^c=ab$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8e582c8e52581442f9551e92526cb3f5b172668.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^k=(ab)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"79\" height=\"20\" />. Sub in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/0/3807837ecb75272782349444bd36f99ff1eefa86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8^c$\" width=\"15\" height=\"12\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/6/176acb9b7084785a658de3aaceaeae717f6f3de0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=3c$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" />. So now we have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b70bc074a999f25fef06d3324c65312c656961a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k+c=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/6/176acb9b7084785a658de3aaceaeae717f6f3de0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=3c$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> which gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/7/8271d4342b38d2ab38bb626ffad8b9dae00b5e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/0566a0e99ebec25620d813cbbedde7217e929ed4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=9$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />. This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/0/e20bbdca63ea0d05c774b4d7cad920e47968dc59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 {a^2b^2}=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"99\" height=\"19\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/3/51309fb31fce11a046b2adb71048258cca3b8e27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4^9=(ab)^2 \\implies ab=(2^2)^9 \\implies 2^9 \\implies \\boxed {512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"363\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Add the equations and use the facts that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/b/3dbcd58dcb84709210b3d282ea6c6076f28403e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log{a} +\\log{b}=\\log{ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"161\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4cbca17490d088a9b2d0095d30390f46f37378.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log{k^n} =n\\log{k}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"120\" height=\"16\" /> to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/3/e439cf1d0b79c0ac19e45f12033fc29b1e20276c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_8{ab} +2\\log_4{ab}=12\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"17\" />\nNow use the change of base identity with base as 2:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/5/fb5496fd59212de6f9fcf836104bb504aea01564.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\dfrac{\\log_2{ab}}{\\log_2{8}}+\\dfrac{2\\log_2{ab}}{\\log_2{4}}=12\\]\" width=\"185\" height=\"42\" />\nWhich gives:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/52195281b717c603bfa699f7bec79f2a45d872c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{4}{3}\\log_2{ab}=12\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"37\" />\nSolving gives, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/e/5eec31950eb9dcff9726ec16b1402462bbabfe63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{ab=2^9=512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"121\" height=\"26\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7\">Solution 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By properties of logarithms, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/7/e2742d8a4d2143d4eac3340a01500ec595a4cb17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 {a}+ \\log_4 {b ^ 2} = \\log_2 {a ^ {1/3}}+ \\log_2 {b} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"300\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>Using the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/3/1a36db6dfbb02f19081b73f2bf051ca6004ea948.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a {b}  + \\log_a {c}  = log_a{b*c}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"195\" height=\"17\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/0/310e7900ee5f133b0ef6a6218f979f665a11e2a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 {a^{1/3} * b} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"122\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>Similarly, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/2/af2c80a91a54848c4f3d6e35f26b8cf9bf1136fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 {a * b^{1/3}} = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"125\" height=\"23\" />. \n</p><p>From these two equations, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/d/ead8b88dab7cb415dc5e67d53963f69827256d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{1/3} * b = 2^5$\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4e941e622842faee13b829f1522e261710d379.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a * b^{1/3} = 2^7$\" width=\"95\" height=\"16\" />. \n</p><p>Multiply the two equations to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/1/dd161ef246fadec91f397ef75ca9a19cf63ece24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{4/3} * b^{4/3} = 2^{12}$\" width=\"122\" height=\"16\" />. Solving, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9e08dde6a9aaa299373ab666db04c59214c0df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a*b = 2^{12*3/4} = 2^9 =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"171\" height=\"18\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/4575d9e1ae3506c2a68367b3039c89452b385980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_8\">Solution 8</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 8\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Adding both of the equations, we get \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/3/e439cf1d0b79c0ac19e45f12033fc29b1e20276c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_8{ab} +2\\log_4{ab}=12\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"17\" />\nFurthermore, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/e/79eedbb6c0618999cfdb8a58ca571335a484cae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 {ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/d/cfdbd19877c13d1755e01b54ba640f512c883a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> times <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/9/159640cd87eaef750aa0443983885c636b914d8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 {ab}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"19\" /> Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/d/c1da09d7ce2f670481d0bc64690cc11e22d1616d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 {ab}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/0/6d0382f3585219947b495ac2262a81b7b0c40db2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"17\" height=\"13\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/2/1a2f2f75245f09a0e960808df549f99b51483cdc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+3x=12,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"101\" height=\"17\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/46778b298c4388021856476834642da3e778b4fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3.$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/1/2d1030d4bb1488e9598bab026f459462469be4bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 {ab} = 3,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"92\" height=\"19\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/7/1078598e203a4e3c4424ff7aef3f80d068663c7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab= 8^3=\\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"123\" height=\"25\" /> ~ math_comb01\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_9\">Solution 9</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 9\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Change all equations to base 64. We then get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccbb769afdd8c0822dba4ef7704a2938debf935c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{64}(a^2) + \\log_{64}(b^6) = 5\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f3381e829363c8d55fe2a55f41e070fb16b26ee.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{64}(b^2) + \\log_{64}(a^6) = 7.\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Using the property \\(\\log(a) + \\log(b) = \\log(ab)\\), we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/6/6a62d15017378aeea91fe1571ffb72b6256a5f70.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{64}(a^2b^6) = 5\\]\" width=\"116\" height=\"20\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/8/648185786fdb8c2ce1078f3c43d7ed8ad7b33afa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\log_{64}(a^6b^2) = 7.\\]\" width=\"120\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Then:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/a/0cab0b80a3e2145b09ae0aabba253483881eec07.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2b^6 = 64^5\\]\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/7/87719db22965c547082a8c64d12a35ac8421329b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^6b^2 = 64^7.\\]\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying, we have:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/6/1c6bc8a5dc37b713c706ae46f270040d058610eb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab^3 = 8^5\\]\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79c4eae9ea34a5ee1a38331ea2b05849130de2d1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^3b = 8^7.\\]\" width=\"68\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Substituting and solving, we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/9/f7941580ff2e0b22157d765ea686db0c4dcf4e5f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a = 8^2\\]\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />\nand\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b0045ed297898c59d19b9ed0142f9817c1d8b279.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = 8.\\]\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Then:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/a/0bada143d93b5468187257f9cf0194ac80e0bbc6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab = 8^3 = 512.\\]\" width=\"112\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_10\">Solution 10</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 10\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Given:\n- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79b6eb535d21832b687ac90733f664a5fc12dd2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 b^2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"21\" />\n- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33e6d465188821af3621f27ff1ded61fd10399b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 a^2 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>We set up a system by subtracting 2 from the second equation to make both equal to 5:\n- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79b6eb535d21832b687ac90733f664a5fc12dd2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 b^2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"21\" />\n- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/0/b30f96c6ef7326466c8ccf7163150a66add4c0f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 a^2 - 2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Setting these equal:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/2/eb2db16016ebb74597e800c6292c0a3b86c90f2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 b^2 = \\log_8 b + \\log_4 a^2 - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"287\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Using the property <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/b/34baeca3e48ea92fb4acae1abcaf68d565b84b6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 x^2 = 2\\log_4 x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"134\" height=\"21\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/b/7eb20569c3b27619d7023e88bd3a49e410a8119e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + 2\\log_4 b = \\log_8 b + 2\\log_4 a - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"297\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Converting to base 2, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/0/a903977ecd75fd0953bed9a0b38c54715d56560e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 x = \\frac{\\log_2 x}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"39\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/5326ad32dc6f08e84b41a46d897fe95bb7855f6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 x = \\frac{\\log_2 x}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"119\" height=\"39\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/a/c2a572ee0d5caae9f0fc3015096c089de697aa86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_2 a}{3} + 2\\cdot\\frac{\\log_2 b}{2} = \\frac{\\log_2 b}{3} + 2\\cdot\\frac{\\log_2 a}{2} - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"333\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Simplifying:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/9/8b99741b21b69f268b8a64054b875b100005c1e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_2 a}{3} + \\log_2 b = \\frac{\\log_2 b}{3} + \\log_2 a - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"280\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Multiplying through by 6 to eliminate fractions:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/4/0a4a20fdd51d46b831927b0e6d1ed90f00cc4fb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\log_2 a + 6\\log_2 b = 2\\log_2 b + 6\\log_2 a - 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"330\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Rearranging:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/f/aff6b8cec3fd181263f97744e01c7da8f7b68ed7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\log_2 a - 6\\log_2 a + 6\\log_2 b - 2\\log_2 b = -12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"344\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1aae993d997d71487d02819d337ea6205a7e6dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-4\\log_2 a + 4\\log_2 b = -12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3bec6b6faae4cca288bacf4715e64c8ae1025a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 b - \\log_2 a = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"157\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Therefore:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/f/d8fb94ddb1623fa11e735d56e3bc0b4c6b653676.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2\\left(\\frac{b}{a}\\right) = -3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"123\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/0/9d0093a235955a947efc896db5e4f1edf0db03ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b}{a} = \\frac{1}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0fb605edcbb42137795fea6e296a17ac0890964.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{a}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>From the first original equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79b6eb535d21832b687ac90733f664a5fc12dd2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 b^2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0fb605edcbb42137795fea6e296a17ac0890964.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{a}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"34\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/a/17a9d14dacf64defe47ed81a6f283f754c496866.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 \\left(\\frac{a}{8}\\right)^2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"177\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/89185992a8c0f0267bc7f681904d34c11fe39384.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 \\left(\\frac{a^2}{64}\\right) = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"183\" height=\"45\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/2/a92f014b93d88271f2b57fbcd4b3e2888329ef77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 a^2 - \\log_4 64 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"226\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f375b3d41d7c732ec11625552260b2f88ecd1305.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_4 64 = \\log_4 4^3 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"21\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913102c73d79501bb23589d2ac7be364e2e4cd8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 a^2 - 3 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"183\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e579f965c1aab120821fb50f8bac706edc8d9877.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 a^2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Now we have:\n- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e579f965c1aab120821fb50f8bac706edc8d9877.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a + \\log_4 a^2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"152\" height=\"21\" /> (derived)\n- <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/e/33e6d465188821af3621f27ff1ded61fd10399b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 a^2 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"150\" height=\"21\" /> (given)\n</p><p>Subtracting:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30c2b13cd9b27a2522d7bd3e25a8525f93d2f291.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 a - \\log_8 b = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/5/395975bf0ac5fd1efc63030d662e997dcc1432a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8\\left(\\frac{a}{b}\\right) = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"104\" height=\"35\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/0/350fd164a0d49732fc29487316057e0ce554d141.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a}{b} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"34\" />\n</p><p>This confirms our earlier finding that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0fb605edcbb42137795fea6e296a17ac0890964.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{a}{8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"47\" height=\"34\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/b/a1b0a1e1cb4dd335d03e1536c0a9f34e48d63dcb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 8b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"53\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting this back into the first original equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/2/00256979c7b2a21a2cbd588d0b312394d49c07df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 (8b) + \\log_4 b^2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/6/ce67f40fccd1a3ab557aed180640c492d378de2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 8 + \\log_8 b + \\log_4 b^2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"214\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb8b632eae4ca22ca5a5a524ab743068c05b5c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + \\log_8 b + \\log_4 b^2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5becef13b83d5bc503f4ccd6e00dd40ad25dba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 b^2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>From the second original equation:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/d/d3d7f8be672100555a058c220f3bcbb213a1ee0d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 (8b)^2 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"169\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/9/3f959739d91d1b76773ab0bee5b86d76fbd9240c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 (64b^2) = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"178\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e3868fc263498f2fa4195c76beb22d7a101a90e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 64 + \\log_4 b^2 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"223\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b5573315abbf71182c8dac14ccffeaa85676cfb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + 3 + \\log_4 b^2 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"180\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5becef13b83d5bc503f4ccd6e00dd40ad25dba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 b^2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Thus both equations yield the same constraint: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5becef13b83d5bc503f4ccd6e00dd40ad25dba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_8 b + \\log_4 b^2 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Converting to base 2:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/5/b7571773e11843fc8dff43a4d2bc052c91a95b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_2 b}{3} + \\frac{2\\log_2 b}{2} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"161\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/7/4273c90192d880a4ed2a4b3dccb60172d3876028.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_2 b}{3} + \\log_2 b = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"145\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/9/ec902010b32c8eccef2b5832fd6bbebd63df091a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_2 b + 3\\log_2 b}{3} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"157\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/b/bfba6636f641bde0fb790fbb2b6a2db6549041de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4\\log_2 b}{3} = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"93\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cff8797635f12e89c21437139489c77ad46993a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 b = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"77\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Therefore:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/5/135a67f50c32144eab1da283ad12c9ba360f9f0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 2^3 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/a/eaadbd3441a9118e9b5094e338a0d7d13551d867.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 8b = 8 \\cdot 8 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"151\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/f/04f827f17dc503dbf2692af34e1b68b2192175b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 64 \\cdot 8 = 512$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"135\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/8/ef870ce9fefe09b80a97b05a7b9198414c1b35f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"19\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/4575d9e1ae3506c2a68367b3039c89452b385980.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~ brandonyee\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_11\">Solution 11</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 11\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us convert everything from the first equation to log base-2. We get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/9/4d93d919f2f085abd153ea34f663d079491de097.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_2{a}}{3} + \\frac{\\log_2{b^2}}{2} = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"158\" height=\"41\" />. Multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80a8da8bbe234418169961bbcd620b4d4ae23dd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\log_2{a} + 3\\log_2{b^2} = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"21\" />. By the properties of logarithms, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/7/dd73eacca895ae8eba3dc478cb269bbfa402a309.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2{a^2b^6} = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027a425c9eb0a5fd2a00c2e92b6d7668c8c3d544.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^2b^6 = 2^{30}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" />. We can use the exact same process for the next equation. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/c/dfcf9266ef30e2fa97a430481de00b8ab3da72d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2{b^2a^6} = 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"111\" height=\"21\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/5/cd570d2ba2b5941c301b3159d95c4c1b89148127.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^6b^2 = 2^{42}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"17\" />. We can now multiply our two equations of products of powers of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/c/b3c7bb3f5e06640077e67332b198451d31d97849.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^8b^8 = 2^{42} \\cdot 2^{30} = 2^{72}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"165\" height=\"17\" />. Taking the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-th root of both sides, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/1/c51b1e5961e53d48460a0fa005d63348b01f1442.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab = 2^{\\frac{72}{8}} = 2^9 = \\boxed{512}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"172\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~idk12345678\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">Logarithm</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME\" title=\"1984 AIME\">1984 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1984 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1984\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1984 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\">AIME Problems and Solutions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination\" title=\"American Invitational Mathematics Examination\">American Invitational Mathematics Examination</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017031420\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.064 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 838/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1431/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28605/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.500      1 Template:AIME_box\n100.00%    7.500      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2777:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017031420 and revision id 282328. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}